<title>UK: Albert Fisher completes sale of U.S. unit.</title>
<headline>Albert Fisher completes sale of U.S. unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food company Albert Fisher Group Plc said on Friday that it has completed the sale of its North American produce distribution business.</p>
<p>It sold the business to a company controlled by a New York-based merchant banking firm Rosecliff Inc for $115 million.</p>
<p>Albert Fisher will retain around 20 percent of the business through the reinvestment of $4.37 million.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
